   "y": 6.1,
   "w": 12,
   "h": 0.25333333333333335,
   "text": "Speed grows linearly with impulse, energy quadratically. Here m_A = ρ_f h_f = 23.3 g/m² (ρ_f = 2330 kg/m³, h_f = 10 µm).",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
